  "question": {
    "text": "Water of volume 2 L in a closed container is heated with a coil of 1 kW. While water is heated, the container loses energy at a rate of 160 J/s. In how much time will the temperature of water rise from 27<sup>o</sup>C to 77<sup>o</sup>C ? (Specific heat of water is 4.2 kJ/kg and that of the container is negligible).",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "WAumR",
      "text": "8 min 20 s",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "aXFZg",
      "text": "7 min",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ZzwXW",
      "text": "14 min",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "oIEec",
      "text": "6 min 2 s",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math> <mrow> <mtext>P</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mn>1</mn> <mn>0</mn> <mn>0</mn> <mn>0</mn> <mtext>&#160;watt</mtext> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;&#160;&#160;&#160;</mo><msub><mtext>P</mtext><mtext>in</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mn>0</mn><mn>0</mn><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>J/s</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mn>4</mn><mn>0</mn><mtext>&#160;J/s</mtext></math><br /><br />Now, &nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mtext>d</mtext> <mtext>Q</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <mtext>dt</mtext> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>=</mo> <mtext>ms</mtext> <mfrac> <mrow> <mtext>dT</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <mtext>dt</mtext> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</mo><mn>8</mn><mn>4</mn><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mtext>ms</mtext><mfrac><mtext>dT</mtext><mtext>dt</mtext></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>&#8756;&#160;&#160;&#160;</mo> <mtext>dt</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mtext>ms</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>8</mn> <mn>4</mn> <mn>0</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> <mtext>dT</mtext> </mrow> </math><br /><br />Integrating both sides we have;<br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mtext>t</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mtext>ms</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>8</mn> <mn>4</mn> <mn>0</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>&#8747;</mo> <mtext>dT</mtext> </mrow> </math><br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> <mo>&#215;</mo> <mn>1</mn> <mn>0</mn> <mn>0</mn> <mn>0</mn> <mo>&#215;</mo> <mn>1</mn> <msup> <mn>0</mn> <mrow> <mo>-</mo> <mn>6</mn> </mrow> </msup> <mo>&#215;</mo> <mn>1</mn> <mn>0</mn> <mn>0</mn> <mn>0</mn> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>&#215;</mo> <mtext>4.2</mtext> <mo>&#215;</mo> <mn>1</mn> <mn>0</mn> <mn>0</mn> <mn>0</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>8</mn> <mn>4</mn> <mn>0</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>&#215;</mo> <mn>5</mn> <mn>0</mn> </mrow> </math><br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mo>=</mo> <mn>5</mn> <mn>0</mn> <mn>0</mn> <mo>sec</mo> </mrow> </math><br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mo>=</mo> <mn>8&#160;</mn> <mo>min</mo> <mn>2</mn> <mn>0</mn> <mo>sec</mo> </mrow> </math>",
